# New task-ticket directories: stop tracking going forward (existing tracked
# files under data/codex_tasks/ are intentionally left as-is, see git log).
# A bare "data/codex_tasks/" directory-level ignore blocks negation for
# anything nested inside it (git cannot re-include a path whose parent
# directory is itself excluded), so this uses the layered
# exclude/re-include/exclude/re-include form instead, to let RESULT.md and
# TEST_RESULT.md (the Codex Verify evidence-manifest files) stay tracked
# while everything else under each ticket directory remains untracked.
data/codex_tasks/*/*
!data/codex_tasks/*/OUTPUTS/
data/codex_tasks/*/OUTPUTS/*
!data/codex_tasks/*/OUTPUTS/RESULT.md
!data/codex_tasks/*/OUTPUTS/TEST_RESULT.md

